   NINOMIYA Y, 2004, SOC OPT ENG J, V10, P180.
   ROWAN, 2003, J REMOTE SENSING ENV, V16, P350.
   Rowan LC, 2000, J GEOCHEM EXPLOR, V68, P145, DOI 10.1016/S0375-6742(99)00081-3.
   Vincent R.K., 1997, Fundamentals of Geological and Environmental RemoteSensing, P366.},
Number-of-Cited-References = {12},
