   RADIOMETER ASTER; HYDROTHERMAL ALTERATION; GEOCHEMICAL ANOMALIES;
   ALTERATION ZONE; EASTERN DESERT; AREA; DEPOSITS; SEPARATION},
Research-Areas = {Environmental Sciences \& Ecology; Geology; Remote Sensing; Imaging
